{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_06",
  "title": "領主宅邸攻防戰",
  "storyCode": "OD-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "641465314cd69baa227e6eaf417a8c286feaae3fc4c972db3906334fcb2d8a49",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "我們有多久沒見面了，我親愛的妹妹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "半年，一年，還是更久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "德魯奇，你襲擊領主衛隊，攻佔領主府邸，這是在謀反！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "謀反，哼，呵呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "你應該知道，皮加爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "如果不是老頭子那腐朽的腦袋裡還想著保護他那些感染的......啊，劣質資產。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "這位子根本輪不到你坐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "冷靜點，妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "看看這個，這些玩具來自一位哥倫比亞的熱心贊助商。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "TSW-2號超聲波衝擊裝置，高科技工業產品，尚未投入實戰的實驗武器，唯一的缺點是尺寸太大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "我把它藏在鎮子裡，可是花了不少時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "把你從大宅裡騙出來，也花了我不少時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "所以我親愛的妹妹，你那強大的武技起到什麼作用了？你堅強的意志又起到什麼作用了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "你再看看這些朋友，這些薩卡茲朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "他們可不是那些死腦筋的魔族佬，他們同樣來自哥倫比亞，他們為錢辦事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "你知道這代表著什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "他們代表著更先進的東西，是你和老頭子永遠都不會明白的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "只要利潤夠高，金錢能匯聚的力量遠超你的想像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "老頭子堅持的那些狗屁不通的道理，現在又到哪兒去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "老大，我們在一間大房子裡找到了這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "哦，巴耶勒王酋的領主委任書。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "細紋草紙，繡邊簽名，磚塊一樣的巴耶勒文，還有這黝黑蓋章。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "老頭子呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "沒有，我們找遍了所有房間，大宅裡只有一大群鎮民，沒看到你說的老頭子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "父親已經過世了，現在我就是長泉鎮的領主。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "你違抗領主，就是違抗王酋，你已經死罪難逃了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "這就是你和那個老東西想出來的計謀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "唔呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "老東西真的是越來越蠢了。你們居然覺得依靠王酋就能將我一軍，你真的是天真得可笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "死罪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "老頭子引以為豪的瑞柏巴衛隊現在就躺在巷子裡身首異處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "最棘手的領主衛隊已經沒了，你覺得這裡還有誰能管我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "你這個喪心病狂的廢物！他們從小看著你長大！你竟然......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "他們不該擋我的道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "你也不該。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "看在我們血脈相連的份上，我就講得再直白一點，便於你理解吧，妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "是，你現在是薩爾貢的領主，沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "而我呢？我只是一個被家族放逐的流浪漢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "但過個幾年，等到你不幸亡故，再由我親自去一趟巴耶勒王廷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "我既有血統，又帶著礦產和大筆財富向王酋表忠心，你覺得他會不會把長泉鎮重新分封給我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "我再好心地做一個假設，如果你上任沒多久就在一場血戰中喪生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "我把你的遺體獻給王酋，假若你有幸成為長生軍的一員，我會不會因此獲得更多好處？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "德魯奇，你這個卑鄙無恥的敗類！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "別這麼激動，妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "當然，前述內容都只是我的假設，假設不會成真，這只是兄妹談心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "因為我早就想好了更適合你的去處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "看到這些身上帶石塊的東西嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "既然你那麼願意保護感染者，不妨就加入他們吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "德魯奇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "等你因此而亡的時候，我會找個山洞把你填進去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "這樣，你和老頭就能看著我是怎麼把礦洞底下深藏的源石挖出來，讓長泉鎮變成整個巴耶勒的礦產中心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "怎麼，不說話了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "......你在出賣你的家族，出賣這片土地！我詛咒你，德魯奇，你不得好死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "隨你開心，我親愛的妹妹，你想咒多久就咒多久，趁你還有本事說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "那就這樣吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）你，過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）老闆，你說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）把那些感染者帶到學者那邊去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "咳咳......咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）好的，我把他們帶給科學家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）這個年輕人呢？看起來快不行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）是死是活都帶過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）至於我妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）把她變成感染者，你們薩卡茲人肯定知道怎麼弄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）不過這可不是合約規定的工作內容，得加錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "（哥倫比亞語）別那麼多廢話。往長遠看，等我們的事成了，礦山運作起來，有的是錢可分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "你可真是有個好哥哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "（閉上了眼睛）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "（舉起武器）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "還有敵人！架盾，保護頭兒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "怎麼回事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "頭兒，還有敵人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "領主衛隊的人不是都被幹掉了嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "我看見了！我看見了！那是個......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "呃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "text": "術師，快讓怪物動起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "術師雇傭兵",
      "text": "稍等......我看看......這個要......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "動作搞快一點！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "啊啊啊！我的肩膀！我的肩膀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "不要慌亂，敵人在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "沒......沒看到！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "先撤退，敵人有弓弩，別待在空曠地！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "掩護德魯奇老闆，他可不能出事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "我看到了！是個菲林！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "小心！撤退！撤退！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "是你......你是羅德島的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "你還能動嗎，瑞柏巴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "text": "謝謝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "源石畸變體",
      "text": "嘎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "術師雇傭兵",
      "text": "好，動起來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
